    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Planetary Destruction\" Category allies' Ki +2 and\nATK & DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g}, plus an additional Ki +1, DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\nand chance of performing a critical hit 15%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters\nwho also belong to the \"Space-Traveling Warriors\" Category\n*For 1 turn from the character's entry turn*\n- Damage reduction rate 25%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 1st attacker in a turn*\n- Guards all attacks\n- Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack with 4 or more\nKi Spheres obtained\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- ATK 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- Guards all attacks and damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g} with\n4 or more Ki Spheres obtained\n*When attacking*\n- ATK 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*Whenever guard is activated*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 200%)\n*When there is another \"Planetary Destruction\" Category ally\nattacking in the same turn*\n- Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- An additional damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g} when there is\nanother \"Space-Traveling Warriors\" Category ally attacking\nin the same turn",
